+---
+id: task-002-track-task-creation-and-update-times
+type: task
+title: "Track task creation and update times"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add ISO-8601 `createdAt` and `updatedAt` fields to every task. They are equal when a task is created.
+Completing, reopening, renaming, tagging, and untagging a task refreshes `updatedAt`; `createdAt`
+remains stable. Keep domain operations deterministic by supplying timestamps from the application
+boundary, and cover creation plus each supported task mutation with automated tests.
